                    "patching_rect": [ 17.0, 18.0, 687.0, 114.0 ],
                    "text": "bachmcp.shmbuffer~\n\nshm stands for SHared Memory.\n\nThis objects opens a buffer in memory that's accessible from outside Max to enable offline processing with more powerful tools, such a Python, which opens the possibilities to leverage AI and machine-learning advanced processing.\n\nbachmcp.shmbuffer~ reads and writes from shared memory and can also read and write from max standard buffers~"
                }
